        "detailed_description": "<h1>NEW GIGA UPDATE is LIVE</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/13b537e31aee785a16338e7f0b8414d7.avif?t=1789066821\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras_big/13b537e31aee785a16338e7f0b8414d7.avif?t=1789066821 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/c41c101c2a1ce38897a2796db1dc9d23.avif?t=1789066821\" width=1182 height=177 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5e8c9f763bb181bffd19347b788531c7.poster.avif?t=1789066821\" width=610 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5e8c9f763bb181bffd19347b788531c7.webm?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5e8c9f763bb181bffd19347b788531c7.mp4?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Start your career in <strong>IT</strong> and face problems inspired by the real work of a technical department. Take tickets, diagnose faults, and search for their causes on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game won't always tell you exactly what to do. <strong>Read the documentation, analyze the configuration, check the logs, and use available tools.</strong> Sometimes the solution will take just a few clicks; other times it will require the right command in the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><u>Think like an IT specialist.</u></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/8475e0a07258165e9fab12bdce98c316.avif?t=1789066821\" width=1182 height=188 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.poster.avif?t=1789066821\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.webm?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/220b1c7384b3e67edcd57af36ed24c12.mp4?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Work with an extensive, simulated IT infrastructure. Configure computers, servers, routers, switches, access points, printers, and other devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Resolve issues related to the <strong>network, TCP/IP, system, drivers, hardware, users, permissions, Wi-Fi, BIOS, or software.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use <strong>CMD and PowerShell</strong>, test connections, check configuration, and find the source of the problem instead of looking for a ready-made &quot;Fix&quot; button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/50e7f9d72646ef0cd4bd441d5438e8c4.avif?t=1789066821\" width=1182 height=177 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.poster.avif?t=1789066821\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.webm?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/5783b6564e71f2f6f2482ad168bc2e78.mp4?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your responsibilities do not end with user computers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Configure IP addressing, gateways, DNS, routers, switches, and access points. Manage servers and an environment inspired by <strong>Active Directory</strong> — users, groups, computers, and permissions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Devices operate within a shared infrastructure so that <u><strong>a single mistake can affect the entire network.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/13dcff982b06bdde77dbb4aab5a4a923.avif?t=1789066821\" width=1182 height=178 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/679ef8e14b031d895245fa3465b5ca0b.poster.avif?t=1789066821\" width=610 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/679ef8e14b031d895245fa3465b5ca0b.webm?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/679ef8e14b031d895245fa3465b5ca0b.mp4?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Develop your career towards programming as well. Write and run real code directly inside the IT Specialist Simulator environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Learn and utilize <strong>Python, Flask, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, SQL, and Git</strong>. Create scripts, websites, and web applications, work with databases, and launch your own projects in a simulated network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Write code. Test. Make mistakes. Fix them.</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/602531d6c083898bfb811d3cec914d6a.avif?t=1789066821\" width=1180 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.poster.avif?t=1789066821\" width=610 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.webm?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266090/extras/a396cc5fe9c98d2e9538d3350aa2336f.mp4?t=1789066821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">IT Specialist Simulator is not about playing a series of identical mini-games. You receive a ticket, tools, and access to the infrastructure — you must find the way to solve the problem yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From a simple computer issue to corporate network configuration and server administration, and even creating your own applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><u><strong>Solve tickets. Gain experience. Develop skills. Become an IT specialist.</strong></u></p>",
